    {
      "part": "worked_solution",
      "original_record": "history",
      "value": "The binomial coefficient $(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{n}{r})$ is given by the formula\n\n$$\n(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{n}{r})=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!\\,r!}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $n=7$ and $r=4.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\genfrac{}{}{0pt}{}{7}{4}) & =\\frac{7!}{(7-4)!\\cdot 4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\cdot 6\\cdot 5\\cdot 4!}{3!\\cdot 4!} \\\\  & =\\frac{7\\cdot \\cancel{6}\\cdot 5\\cdot \\cancel{4!}}{\\cancel{6}\\cdot \\cancel{4!}} \\\\  & =7\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =35.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "original_html_sha256": "87d2520822aaa056df95e4949f5b65c9e3100a1f88879663c3adc5787b125440",
      "extractor_sha256": "af03036879151d6bc1d8a980c3dbf01d042d978e39d96a25bdfe63cd50ef1a10",
